            <p>
              How does magmatism promote and shape rifts in continental and
              oceanic lithosphere? In this project (PI Richard Katz, U. Oxford),
              we focused on magma generation and transport at spreading ridges,
              but also on deformation of the host rock to investigate processes
              such as diking and faulting. We also developed numerical tools
              (FD-PDE framework) that are suitable for magma dynamics theory
              with visco-elasto-plastic rheology. (2019-2024)
